 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cover the glass noodles with warm water and soak for <b>30 minutes</b>. Soak the dried shiitake in a separate cup of warm water.</li><li>Pat the chicken dry. If the drumsticks or thighs are very large, ask the butcher to chop them in half through the bone, or leave them whole.</li><li>Peel the potatoes and carrot and cut them into <b>large <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"4\" data-s=\"0\">4 cm</span> chunks</b>; they braise for a long time and must not fall apart. Cut the onion through the root into thick lengthwise wedges. Cut the spring onions into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"4\" data-s=\"0\">4 cm</span> lengths.</li><li>Mix the soy sauce, brown sugar, oyster sauce, minced garlic, ginger and pepper into the braising sauce.</li></ul>",
