  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour in the braising sauce and the water. Scrape the bottom of the pan with a wooden spatula so the brown film dissolves into the liquid. Add the dried chillies, if using.</li><li>Bring to a boil, cover, then lower to <b>medium-low</b> and braise for <b>15 minutes</b>. Turn the pieces once halfway.</li></ul>",
