  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Squeeze the shiitake, remove the stems and halve the caps. Tuck the potato, carrot and shiitake between the chicken pieces so they sit in the liquid.</li><li>Cover and braise for <b>12–15 minutes</b>, until a knife slides into the potato with little resistance.</li></ul>",
