   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Take off the lid and add the onion and the white parts of the spring onion. Raise the heat to <b>medium</b> and simmer for <b>5 minutes</b>. Spoon the sauce over the chicken as it thickens.</li><li>Stop when about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> of sauce is left: the noodles still need some to absorb. If it is already shallow, add <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"100\" data-s=\"0\">100 ml</span> water.</li></ul>",
